    skos:definition "This relation can only represent essential parthood if the object representing the whole is extensional (i.e. provided that adding or removing of any member changes the identity of the collective). In this case, all parthood relations in which the whole is extensional are constrained as {essential} parthood relations. .. _memberOf-constraints-c2:" ;
