<https://w3id.org/ontouml/knowledge#constraint/c2-bd0621a86cd30e83> a ok:Constraint ;
    rdfs:label "Mixin C2" ;
    skos:definition "A «mixin» is a semi-rigid construct and because of that, it cannot have as ancestor either a rigid (other than «category») or an anti-rigid type. Therefore, only :ref:`mixins <mixin>>` and :ref:`categories <category>>` can be ancestor of other mixins. .. container:: figure [figure:Mixin forbidden 1] .. [figure:Mixin application 2] image:: _images/ontouml_mixin-application-2.png .. [figure:Mixin forbidden 1] image:: _images/ontouml_mixin-forbidden-1.png" ;
