        ontouml:mixin,
        ontouml:rigidity ;
    ok:sourceText """A «:ref:`mixin`» is a :ref:`semi-rigid <rigidity>` construct and because of that, it cannot have as ancestor either a :ref:`rigid <rigidity>` (other than «:ref:`category`») or an :ref:`anti-rigid <rigidity>` type. Therefore, only :ref:`mixins <mixin>>` and :ref:`categories <category>>` can be ancestor of other mixins.

