principle <identity>`, a «:ref:`subkind`» cannot have an :ref:`non-sortal type <identity>` («:ref:`category`», «:ref:`mixin`», «:ref:`rolemixin`» and «:ref:`phasemixin`») as a descendant, i.e., a direct or indirect subtype.
