<https://w3id.org/ontouml/knowledge#refactoring/1-6e91431367f2182c> a ok:RefactoringPlan ;
    rdfs:label "WholeOver refactoring 1" ;
    skos:definition "*[OCL] Exclusiveness:* choose this option to forbid the same individual to play multiple roles w.r.t the same whole instance. Create an OCL invariant according to the following template: [figure: context Whole ] inv: self.over1.oclAsType(Supertype)->asSet()->excludesAll( [figure: self.over2.oclAsType(Agent)->asSet() and ] self.over1.oclAsType(Supertype)->asSet()->excludesAll( [figure: self.over3.oclAsType(Agent)->asSet() and ] self.over2.oclAsType(Supertype)->asSet()->excludesAll( | self.over3.oclAsType(Agent)->asSet())*" ;
