<https://w3id.org/ontouml/knowledge#refactoring/4-1ed12e59009a4c77> a ok:RefactoringPlan ;
    rdfs:label "[OCL] Derived by Intersection:" ;
    skos:definition "[OCL] Derived by Intersection: create an OCL derivation or invariant constraint to specify that the extension of type is derived by the intersection of the extensions of two or more concrete parents: [figure: context Parent1 ] inv: (self.oclIsTypeOf(Parent2) and self.oclIsTypeOf(Parent2)) | implies self.oclIsTypeOf(Type)" ;
