	\\*Assuming that the occurrence is the structural variation number 1.""" .

<https://w3id.org/ontouml/knowledge#refactoring/5-af5d95dea7153fcf> a ok:RefactoringPlan ;
    rdfs:label "[OCL] Set Custom Existential Composition:" ;
    skos:definition "[OCL] Set Custom Existential Composition: add an OCL invariant to enforce that type B has a custom existential composition to type A: [figure: context BSource ] inv: self.bTarget->asSet()->forAll( y [figure: ] ASource.allInstances()->select( z [figure: ] z.aTarget->asSet()->contains(y) and [figure: z.aTarget->asSet()->contains(self))->size()[>]<|=]n)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <urn:ontouml:source:anti-patterns/anti-patterns/RelComp/index.rst> ;
    ok:order 5 ;
